                    <i class="fas fa-layer-group me-2"></i>5-Layer Hybrid Crop Recommendation Architecture
                </h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body p-4 small">
                <div class="alert alert-light border mb-3">
                    <strong>Research Citation:</strong> “Hybrid AI-Driven Crop Recommendation Model Based on Soil Nutrient Analysis and Weather-Driven Environmental Factors” (Non-ML Multi-Criteria Decision Formulation).
                </div>
                <div class="row g-3">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border h-100">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold text-success"><i class="fas fa-vial me-1"></i> Layer 1: Soil Nutrients</h6>
                            <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Evaluates Nitrogen, Phosphorus, Potassium, and Soil pH using piecewise continuous suitability membership curves against ICAR agronomic thresholds.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border h-100">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold text-primary"><i class="fas fa-filter me-1"></i> Layer 2: Contextual Filter</h6>
                            <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Applies season validity (Kharif, Rabi, Zaid) and soil texture compatibility (Alluvial, Black, Clay, Sandy, Laterite) to eliminate out-of-season crops early.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border h-100">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold text-info"><i class="fas fa-cloud-sun me-1"></i> Layer 3: Weather Integration</h6>
                            <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Fetches live ambient temperature, relative humidity, and rainfall via Open-Meteo & IMD APIs to score thermal and moisture feasibility.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border h-100">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold text-warning"><i class="fas fa-coins me-1"></i> Layer 4: Regional Profitability</h6>
                            <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Integrates live Agmarknet 2.0 GoI mandi modal prices. If live prices are unavailable, the layer is omitted without fabricating fake figures.</p>
